~ start
Wow, what a comfy bed!
Its texture and softness feel like it could take you to another dimension.
...
Would you like to rest here?
- Save the game and continue.
	do SaveLoad._save()
	do FadeTransition.fade(1, 1)
	Saving......[wait=1]
	do Main.get_tree().paused = true
	Save complete.
	do FadeTransition.fade(0, 2)
	do Main.get_tree().paused = false
	Good luck on your adventure!
	Fold the sheets on your way out.
- Wake up?
	[rainbow] WARNING![/rainbow]
	When you wake up, you won't be able to return here for some time. In the waking world, you will find a way to return.
	I trust that you will know how to dream again.
	So do you wish to wake from this Reverie?
	- I want to eep.
		do SaveLoad._save()
		do FadeTransition.fade(1, 1)
		Your eyes grow heavy. 
		...
		By the power of reversing REM sleep, the game is saved.
		do Main.get_tree().paused = true
		Save complete.
		do Main.switch_level("res://indev/rooms/dev_room_05.tscn")
		do FadeTransition.fade(0, 2)
		do Main.get_tree().paused = false
	- I'm not tired.
		One day you will be. And you will be groggy, overencumbered and crawling back to me.
- No
	You work hard! But don't work yourself too hard.
	
=> END